      "username": "Drakossozh",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/f05b48/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-03-24T15:49:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So, for example, I am able to draw the last card from the deck (leaving the deck empty), but NOT draw any more than that, I don't have to reshuffle immediately?</p><p>That is to say, Lightning-speed Barrage will still do a whole load of damage vs no damage at all? :O</p>",
